    add bow to {pof.items.weapons::*}
    add bow to {pof.items.weapons::*}
    add arrow to {pof.items.weapons::*}
    add fishing rod to {pof.items.weapons::*}
    add snowball to {pof.items.weapons::*}
    add stick to {pof.items.weapons::*}
    add leather helmet to {pof.items.armor::*}
